{"id":"nac_a_o","lemma":"nação","pos":"noun","rank":1681,"glosses":["nation (group of people sharing aspects of language, culture and/or ethnicity)","nation (country)"],"ipa":"/naˈsɐ̃w̃/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"nações"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-na%C3%A7%C3%A3o.wav","examples":[{"text":"Toda a nação quer paz.","en":"The whole nation wants peace.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/76250","words":[{"g":"of the Toda people"},{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"peace"}]},{"text":"Somos uma nação que ama a paz.","en":"We're a peace-loving nation.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to love","l":"amar"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"peace"}]},{"text":"O bem estar da nação é responsabilidade do governo.","en":"The well being of the nation is the government's responsibility.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"of the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"responsibility"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"government"}]},{"text":"A nação estava em paz.","en":"The nation was at peace.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"peace"}]},{"text":"Toda nação tem seus próprios mitos.","en":"Every nation has its own myths.","words":[{"g":"of the Toda people"},null,{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"their or your kin"},{"g":"own","l":"próprio"},{"g":"traditional story","l":"mito"}]}]}